  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>32</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;are the coefficients of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;respectively, hence</p><p><math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>96</mn></math> and <math><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>132</mn></math></p>"
